{"id":"b14b710944eb2928","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-prefix-free-machine.md","title":"前缀自由机器与最优性","display":"df-prefix-free-machine — 前缀自由机器与最优性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-prefix-free-machine","aliases":["20-df-prefix-free-machine"],"display":"df-prefix-free-machine — 前缀自由机器与最优性","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.randomness","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"本地补充定义；不归入 Soare 2016 第 11 章的原陈述","depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-prefix-free-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-prefix-free-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prefix-free-machine — 前缀自由机器与最优性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.randomness"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地补充定义；不归入 Soare 2016 第 11 章的原陈述"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,U:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(M,U:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{code}:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega\\)</span> 是已固定的双射编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span> 为扩展自然数上的最大元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty+c=+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty+c=+\\infty\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix-free-machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\widehat M(\\operatorname{code}(p))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(x)\n\\Longleftrightarrow M(p)\\downarrow=x,\\\\\n\\mathscr M:=\\{M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\widehat M\\in\\mathcal C_1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\ [p\\preceq q\\Rightarrow p=q],\\\\\nK_M(x):=\\min\\{|p|:M(p)\\downarrow=x\\}\\quad(\\min\\varnothing:=+\\infty),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Optimal}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\nU\\in\\mathscr M\\land\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(U)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathscr M\\ [\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(M)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ K_U(x)\\le K_M(x)+c].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix-free-machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\widehat M(\\operatorname{code}(p))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(x)\n\\Longleftrightarrow M(p)\\downarrow=x,\\\\\n\\mathscr M:=\\{M:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\widehat M\\in\\mathcal C_1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\ [p\\preceq q\\Rightarrow p=q],\\\\\nK_M(x):=\\min\\{|p|:M(p)\\downarrow=x\\}\\quad(\\min\\varnothing:=+\\infty),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Optimal}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\nU\\in\\mathscr M\\land\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(U)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathscr M\\ [\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(M)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ K_U(x)\\le K_M(x)+c].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原始串函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 与其自然数编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat M\">\\(\\widehat M\\)</span> 是不同类型；机器的计算性通过编码成员性表达，不能直接把自然数部分函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 中的变量当作串函数来使用前缀关系。</p>\n<p>最优机存在：枚举每个部分可计算串函数的停止图，依发现顺序只接受与已接受定义域不相容的新输入，且每个输入只保留一个输出。这给全部前缀自由机器的有效枚举；本来前缀自由的机器不会被丢掉任何输入。给第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个机器加互不相容的机器号前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^e0\">\\(1^e0\\)</span>，得到一台前缀自由模拟机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，对它的每个模拟目标只增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e+1\">\\(e+1\\)</span> 的程序长度。每个串有某台单程序打印机，故最优机的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U(x)\">\\(K_U(x)\\)</span> 总有限。本书第 11 章没有展开这个复杂度理论，保留为书外局部补充。</p>\n<p>来源：本地补充定义；不归入 Soare 2016 第 11 章的原陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"+\\infty+c=+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix-free-machine}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\widehat M(\\operatorname{code}(p))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(x)\n\\Longleftrightarrow M(p)\\downarrow=x,\\\\\n\\mathscr M:=\\{M:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}:\\widehat M\\in\\mathcal C_1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall p,q\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\ [p\\preceq q\\Rightarrow p=q],\\\\\nK_M(x):=\\min\\{|p|:M(p)\\downarrow=x\\}\\quad(\\min\\varnothing:=+\\infty),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Optimal}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\nU\\in\\mathscr M\\land\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(U)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathscr M\\ [\\operatorname{PrefixFree}(M)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ K_U(x)\\le K_M(x)+c].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"1^e0","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"e+1","display":false},{"tex":"K_U(x)","display":false}],"bytes":2526,"backlinks":[{"id":"decef5fed3c2d53d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-prefix-free-machine]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"编码与模型：[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]、[[20-df-oracle-machine]]、[[20-df-prefix-free-machine]]、[[20-df-lachlan-game]]、[[20-thm-modulus]]。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","e343870c773cb68e"]}